{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23138","headline":"晚春重到集贤院 · 白居易","name":"晚春重到集贤院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官曹清切非人境，风月鲜明是洞天。\n满砌荆花铺紫毯，隔墙榆荚撒青钱。\n前时谪去三千里，此地辞来十四年。\n虚薄至今惭旧职，院名擡举号爲贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}